# Keep the Docker build context (Dockerfile.worker) lean and correct.
# The worker image now self-builds the aish binary in a bookworm builder stage,
# so we must NOT ship host build artifacts (a host-glibc binary is the exact bug
# this multi-stage build exists to avoid) or heavy/irrelevant dirs.

# Host build artifacts — never inject a host-libc binary into the image.
# Both the context-root target/ AND every nested crate target/ (e.g.
# crates/*/target) — the bare `target/` pattern only matches the root.
target/
**/target/

# VCS + coordinator worktrees / state.
.git/
.atum/
worktrees/

# Local dev noise.
*.log
aish.db
aish.db-*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
.DS_Store

# Docs / examples aren't needed to compile the worker.
docs/spikes/
examples/
